msgid "Using Security with JDBC"
msgstr "使用JDBC的安全性"

msgid "This guide demonstrates how your Quarkus application can use a database to store your user identities."
msgstr "本指南展示了你的Quarkus应用程序如何使用数据库来存储你的用户身份。"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

msgid "To complete this guide, you need:"
msgstr "要完成这个指南，你需要："

msgid "Roughly 15 minutes"
msgstr "大概15分钟"

msgid "An IDE"
msgstr "编辑器"

msgid "JDK 11+ installed with `JAVA_HOME` configured appropriately"
msgstr "安装JDK 11以上版本并正确配置了 `JAVA_HOME`"

msgid "Apache Maven {maven-version}"
msgstr "Apache Maven {maven-version}"

msgid "Optionally the xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI] if you want to use it"
msgstr "如果你愿意的话，还可以选择使用xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI]"

msgid "Optionally Mandrel or GraalVM installed and xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[configured appropriately] if you want to build a native executable (or Docker if you use a native container build)"
msgstr "如果你想构建原生可执行程序，可以选择安装Mandrel或者GraalVM，并xref:building-native-image.adoc#configuring-graalvm[正确配置](或者使用Docker在容器中进行构建)"

msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "应用结构"

#, fuzzy
msgid "In this example, we build a very simple microservice which offers three endpoints:"
msgstr "在此示例中，我们将构建一个非常简单的微服务，该服务提供三个端点："

#, fuzzy
msgid "`/api/public`"
msgstr "`/api/public`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "`/api/users/me`"
msgstr "`/api/users/me`"

#, fuzzy
msgid "`/api/admin`"
msgstr "`/api/admin`"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `/api/public` endpoint can be accessed anonymously.\n"
"The `/api/admin` endpoint is protected with RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) where only users granted with the `admin` role can access. At this endpoint, we use the `@RolesAllowed` annotation to declaratively enforce the access constraint.\n"
"The `/api/users/me` endpoint is also protected with RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) where only users granted with the `user` role can access. As a response, it returns a JSON document with details about the user."
msgstr "`/api/public` 端点支持匿名访问。 `/api/admin` 端点受 RBAC（基于角色的访问控制）保护，仅授予 `admin` 角色的用户才能访问。在此端点上，我们使用 `@RolesAllowed` 注解以声明式方式强制执行访问限制。 `/api/users/me` 端点同样受 RBAC（基于角色的访问控制）保护，仅授予 `“user”` 角色的用户才能访问。该端点返回的响应是一个包含用户详细信息的 JSON 文档。"

msgid "Solution"
msgstr "解决方案"

msgid ""
"We recommend that you follow the instructions in the next sections and create the application step by step.\n"
"However, you can go right to the completed example."
msgstr "我们建议您按照下一节的说明逐步创建应用程序。然而，您可以直接转到已完成的示例。"

msgid "Clone the Git repository: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}`, or download an {quickstarts-archive-url}[archive]."
msgstr "克隆 Git 仓库: `git clone {quickstarts-clone-url}` ，或下载一个 {quickstarts-archive-url}[存档] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "The solution is located in the `security-jdbc-quickstart` {quickstarts-tree-url}/security-jdbc-quickstart[directory]."
msgstr "解决方案位于 `security-jdbc-quickstart` {quickstarts-tree-url}/security-jdbc-quickstart[目录]。"

msgid "Creating the Maven Project"
msgstr "创建Maven项目"

msgid "First, we need a new project. Create a new project with the following command:"
msgstr "首先，我们需要一个新的项目。使用以下命令创建一个新的项目:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "CLI"
msgstr "CLI"

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `--gradle` or `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "创建Grade项目，请添加 `--gradle` 或者 `--gradle-kotlin-dsl` 参数。"

msgid "_For more information about how to install the Quarkus CLI and use it, please refer to xref:cli-tooling.adoc[the Quarkus CLI guide]._"
msgstr "_关于如何安装并使用Quarkus CLI的更多信息，请参考xref:cli-tooling.adoc[Quarkus CLI指南]。_"

msgid "Maven"
msgstr "Maven"

msgid "To create a Gradle project, add the `-DbuildTool=gradle` or `-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl` option."
msgstr "创建Grade项目，请添加 `-DbuildTool=gradle` 或者 `-DbuildTool=gradle-kotlin-dsl` 参数。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Don't forget to add the database connector library of choice. Here we are using PostgreSQL as identity store."
msgstr "别忘了添加所选的数据库连接库。这里我们使用 PostgreSQL 作为标识存储。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This command generates a new project, importing the `elytron-security-jdbc` extension\n"
